{"reviews":[{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-0","r":1.0,"t":"The bristles shed within a month>>>","x":"Im an esthetician, and these brushes slowly started shedding on my clients face.  They lasted about a month.  Might be ok for personal at home use not for a professional that require constant washing and disinfecting of tools.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-1","r":5.0,"t":"These are made well.","x":"I absolutely love the quality of these brushes and the price too. They worked great for what I needed them for in my Esthetician business and I highly recommend them.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-2","r":5.0,"t":"good brushes!","x":"I use direct acids on my face, and application has always been a bit of a problem.  The directions say to use a cotton ball, those are too absorbent, and waste pricey product.  I ended up using little fan-shaped brushes designed for paint, which weren't... horrible, but not great either.  Then I came across these, and gave them a try.  They are great!  They hold a good amount of thin or thick liquid in their bristles, and leave an even layer on my face. They are also easy to clean and inexpensiv","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-3","r":1.0,"t":"they are not strong","x":"I would give it 1 stars \ud83c\udf1f.  I used it once and washing it detached the hairs from the brush.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-4","r":1.0,"t":"Very small unrealistic size","x":"These should be considered \u201cminiatures\u201d \ud83d\ude02","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Love using these on clients for facial. So easy to clean. Soft against the face.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-6","r":1.0,"t":"Hold like it is a feather because brush will allot from holder with 3 strokes","x":"They don\u2019t last long. 1-2 uses of that and they detach","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great facial brushes","x":"They are smaller than anticipated, however, I feel like that is a good thing.  It allows me to spread product over my client\u2019s face in a more targeted and detailed manner.  I like them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great purchase","x":"Love these brushes, they don't fan out when product is on them, so the product is able to spread evenly on the face. Very durable as well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-9","r":4.0,"t":"Great price","x":"They feel like silicone brushes and my clients actually like them. Easy to clean and sturdy. But a little smaller than expected","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-10","r":1.0,"t":"Sharp brush / cut unevenly","x":"The bristles began to feel pokey against my skin they\u2019re not cut straight there cut an even unlike the photos","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-11","r":1.0,"t":"Not sturdy. Didn\u2019t hold up like other brushes I use","x":"[[VIDEOID:ae93bf896f8e347037ea23532d28f235]] I can\u2019t believe these didn\u2019t hold up. Very disappointed","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-12","r":5.0,"t":"No regrets","x":"Nice texture of bristles.  Good value.  No complaints. ((I use these to apply acid peels))","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-13","r":4.0,"t":"Smaller than expected.","x":"I like them, they're just smaller than I expected","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-14","r":2.0,"t":"Don\u2019t last","x":"The hair of the brush felts after a few uses","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great for the price!","x":"I don\u2019t have any pictures since they are in my spa currently! But for the price these brushes exceeded my expectations! They are super easy to clean and are very soft. I use them to apply masks to clients faces during facials. They are soft so they feel nice on the face, some brushes on Amazon are hard and shed hairs but these have been great! Had them for a few months now and have had zero issues. As long as you take proper care of them I assume they\u2019d stay nice for a while!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-16","r":5.0,"t":"Just like a professional facial!","x":"I LOVE these. When an esthetician uses this on my face, it's my favorite part of my facial. I wanted to do some self-care and at home facials so I looked up these types of brushes. I was skeptical at the price being so low but they are very nice quality. I use them to put on my cleanser and other light face washes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-17","r":2.0,"t":"Scratchy/Rough bristles","x":"These things seem sturdy, but hard to tell as they are so scratchy/rough that I cannot use them. The bristles are made of a hard plastic or something and does not feel the same as the brushes that aestheticians use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-18","r":5.0,"t":"Facial brushs very soft","x":"Brush handles are a little small but the material they use to make the fan part is wonderful. Used them for a facial and they worked great. Super easy to clean and dried very well with no fraying to the brush.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-19","r":3.0,"t":"Soft Fan","x":"This fan brush is nice and soft but perhaps a little too soft when applying firmer masks. Also, when I wash it, it loses it's shape a bit. This brush will not last too long. But for the price, it will suffice.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-20","r":5.0,"t":"Cute fan brushes !!!","x":"They were not as big as I thought they would be but they definitely get the job done as far as applying facial products. They\u2019re cute , sturdy and soft for the face . Definitely will buy again .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-21","r":5.0,"t":"Soft and perfect for facials!","x":"These brushes were the perfect purchase. I\u2019ve had previous facial brushes that were rough and almost felt like it was exfoliating as applying product but these are extremely soft and comforting","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-22","r":2.0,"t":"Clumps when applying","x":"I use for my glycolic peels which is fairly runny however the brush still clumps when wet for some reason and doesn\u2019t allow me to get ev en application. Will be returning.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-23","r":5.0,"t":"The perfect fan brush","x":"A great brush for applying facial masks and applying make up. Gentle bristles, yet sturdy enough to wash and reuse time and time again. I will definitely be ordering more.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2023"},{"id":"B09B7J4TDS-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great beauty tool","x":"So far  I've used it to apply gel for my Nuface. And it's very good  It saves me the mess on my hands, evenly applied the gel quickly and rinses clean easily and quickly","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Several reviewers report the brushes shed or detach bristles after short use, especially with washing.","cites":[1,4,7,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers find the brushes smaller than expected, though some see the small size as useful for detailed application.","cites":[5,8,10,14]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers praise the brushes as easy to clean, soft, and good quality for facial use.","cites":[2,6,9,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers describe the brushes as not sturdy or durable.","cites":[4,7,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention uneven or sharp bristle cutting that feels pokey.","cites":[11]}]},"qa":[]}